{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"topgrade-rs.topgrade","latestVersion":"17.16.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Detects which tools you use and runs the appropriate commands to update them.","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/topgrade-rs/topgrade/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Detects which tools you use and runs the appropriate commands to update them.","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/topgrade-rs/topgrade/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Keeping your system up to date usually involves invoking multiple package managers. This results in big, non-portable shell one-liners saved in your shell. To remedy this, Topgrade detects which tools you use and runs the appropriate commands to update them.","name":"topgrade","packageUrl":"https://github.com/topgrade-rs/topgrade","publisher":"topgrade-rs","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/topgrade-rs/topgrade/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/topgrade-rs","releaseNotes":"Added\n- (linux) add Omarchy support (#2494)\n- (microsoft_store) add support for the store CLI (#2497)\n- (pre_sudo) run pre_sudo before self-update (#2492)\n- (tailscale) pass --yes when assume_yes is set (#2489)\nFixed\n- (sdkman) source the init script instead of relying on .bashrc (#2482)\n- (tailscale) don't update when installed via homebrew (#2504)\n- (tailscale) gate Tailscale step to Windows and macOS (#2500)\n- (waydroid) skip when Waydroid is not initialized (#2484)\n- (claude-code) don't fail with EOF on long output (#2062)","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/topgrade-rs/topgrade/releases/tag/v17.16.0","tags":["cli","linux","package-management","package-manager","packagemanagement","packagemanagers","requirescmd","rust","updatechecker","updater","updatetool","windows"]}},"longDescription":"Keeping your system up to date usually involves invoking multiple package managers. This results in big, non-portable shell one-liners saved in your shell. To remedy this, Topgrade detects which tools you use and runs the appropriate commands to update them.","name":"topgrade","packageUrl":"https://github.com/topgrade-rs/topgrade","publisher":"topgrade-rs","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/topgrade-rs/topgrade/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/topgrade-rs","releaseNotes":"Added\n- (linux) add Omarchy support (#2494)\n- (microsoft_store) add support for the store CLI (#2497)\n- (pre_sudo) run pre_sudo before self-update (#2492)\n- (tailscale) pass --yes when assume_yes is set (#2489)\nFixed\n- (sdkman) source the init script instead of relying on .bashrc (#2482)\n- (tailscale) don't update when installed via homebrew (#2504)\n- (tailscale) gate Tailscale step to Windows and macOS (#2500)\n- (waydroid) skip when Waydroid is not initialized (#2484)\n- (claude-code) don't fail with EOF on long output (#2062)","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/topgrade-rs/topgrade/releases/tag/v17.16.0","tags":["cli","linux","package-management","package-manager","packagemanagement","packagemanagers","requirescmd","rust","updatechecker","updater","updatetool","windows"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/17.16.0/app.json","detailSha256":"c22d5f547aa45ed14c94c7cd98be337d52868f7f1988d645a0480b12b45298d1","releaseDate":"2026-11-09","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"17.16.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/17.15.0/app.json","detailSha256":"7c9fbc62b7eba7bc5cb6196668ca7a17b2c42c7ecf09433b935504ea2a684b61","releaseDate":"2026-11-03","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"17.15.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/17.14.1/app.json","detailSha256":"0eb86b23a639c75a793d9d45cfebdc1a01d889c03e570607f6aa0f463248cc51","releaseDate":"2026-10-20","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"17.14.1"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/17.14.0/app.json","detailSha256":"01552119